@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Storage and Git execution test boundaries
component "Repository identifier and browser path" as Input
component "Validated logical identity" as Identity
component "Canonical path containment" as Path
folder "Isolated bare Git repository" as Storage
component "Configured Git executable\nStructured arguments; no shell" as Git
artifact "Exit status, bounded output and timeout evidence" as Evidence
Input --> Identity
Identity --> Path
Path --> Storage
Git --> Storage : permitted operation
Git --> Evidence : result or controlled failure
note bottom of Path : Traversal, absolute paths and symlink escape cases
note bottom of Storage : Missing/orphaned storage must not cause unsafe adoption
note bottom of Git : Injection, unsupported commands and timeout cases
@enduml
